	)
	(text "選定面板後逐腳核對完，才可以開始佈這一頁的線。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 64.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8e4991dd-b75c-43a6-be00-04bccf46c350")
	)
	(text "MIPI D-PHY layout（002 §2.1 / §2.2）"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 80.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0ec37e83-7986-44d7-9e0c-017d7005ca9f")
	)
	(text "· 同一對銅線上有兩種訊號：HS 是 200mV 差分、LP 是 1.2V 單端。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2d1e9879-bdc6-471c-bcad-c67718e50d90")
	)
	(text "· 所以不能串任何電阻、不能加 AC 耦合電容 —— 那會破壞 LP 的直流準位。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "80b83351-9716-4857-94e2-79d11535ff70")
	)
	(text "· 100 ohm 差分，對內等長 ±0.1mm，各資料對相對 CK 對 ±0.5mm。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "45437be3-7a27-47cb-bb39-feb9e74ad5ba")
	)
	(text "· 對與對之間 >= 3x 線寬；全程走完整 GND 平面，不跨分割。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aaf9edae-d724-45ef-9e24-9a03861aba06")
	)
	(text "★ 不能有 stub —— 這是這塊板最重要的一條佈線規則"
